{"title":"Gutterclaw","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>A kobold chief named Gutterclaw holds Hollowmark&#39;s deep seam, and he wears the key to the dwarves&#39; strongroom.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/greywood-foreman\">Greywood Foreman</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"greywood-foreman\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/hollowmark-strongroom-key\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/gen/007b655fdf90cc15b836.svg\" alt=\"\">Hollowmark Strongroom Key</a> <b>×1</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/greywood-foreman\">Greywood Foreman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors around -556, -369)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"greywood-foreman\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Gutterclaw <span class=\"muted\">inside <a href=\"#\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"zone\" data-map-id=\"-291\">Hollowmark Mine</a></span><br>Gutterclaw&#39;s key - <a href=\"#/item/hollowmark-strongroom-key\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/gen/007b655fdf90cc15b836.svg\" alt=\"\">Hollowmark Strongroom Key</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -556, -369</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-556|-369|Gutterclaw&#39;s key\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>800</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>25,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Choose one</td><td><a href=\"#/item/silver-legs\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/08ecaf2ee25350d177fd.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Legs</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/bearhide-legs\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/d5f0c0f64a5f6fd492e9.svg\" alt=\"\">Bearhide Legs</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/snakeskin-legs\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/fd826e0571f2523a171c.svg\" alt=\"\">Snakeskin Legs</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Greywood Foreman says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Greywood Foreman:</b> The strongroom key, still on his string. I think I&#39;ll keep the string too.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Greywood Foreman:</b> With Gutterclaw gone, the rest will scatter. My crew can go back to work.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Greywood Foreman:</b> We kept armor in that strongroom for the crew. Take your pick. You&#39;ve earned it more than any of us.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"We kept armor in that strongroom for the crew. Take your pick. You&#39;ve earned it more than any of us.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Gutterclaw</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-gutterclaw\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-gutterclaw\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-gutterclaw\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-gutterclaw\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-gutterclaw\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Greywood Foreman says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-gutterclaw\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}